+//                      requires.  Raw bits, never rescaled here.
+//   collisionDisabled  Bullet::collisionDisabled as an integer (0 collides,
+//                      1 disabled by an ECL transform; EclExIns.cpp:622-708).
+//
+// ENEMY row, after the G0 prefix slot:flags1:posXyz:life:timer3318:
+//   worldPositionXyz   floatBits of Enemy::worldPosition, the centre 11-P1 2.1
