+//   duration           Laser::duration (+0x578): the state-1 length before the
+//                      beam leaves LASER_STATE_ACTIVE (BulletManager.cpp:1126).
+//   despawnDuration    Laser::despawnDuration (+0x57C): the state-2 length; 0
